    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d428">

                <pb facs="0550" n="536" sameAs="frus:frus1947v06/pg536"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">740.0011 PW (Peace)/10–1347: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Acting Secretary of State
                        to the Acting Political Adviser in Japan</hi> (<hi
                            rendition="#italic">Sebald</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">secret</hi>
                    </seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1947-10-13T18:00:00-05:00">October 13, 1947—6
                            p.m.</date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>403. For your info status of Jap peace treaty
                    discussions currently as follows:</p>
                <p>[Here follows summary of developments since July 11.]</p>
                <p>Dept will examine the situation in the light of Dr. Wang’s findings in the matter
                    of the attitude of Soviet and other govts.</p>
                <p>4. Dept will be course keep you informed of significant developments.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Lovett</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
